# Testing

Jangan menambah file `tests/test_*.py`. Perluas coverage di inventaris yang sudah ada lewat **OOP**: `class Test*` + method `test_*`. Setup berulang diambil dari `tests/support/` (MVC). Detail: `docs/testing.md`.

| Domain | File |
|--------|------|
| Pipeline (config → web) | `tests/test_suite.py` |
| Crop / ink / symbolic | `tests/test_crop_symbolic.py` |
| Confirm / recrop / editor crop manual / question_crops / labeler | `tests/test_crop_confirm.py` |
| Number line / figure | `tests/test_number_line.py` |
| Support bersama (bukan kasus uji) | `tests/support/` |

| Support | Lapisan | Contoh |
|---------|---------|--------|
| `builders.py` | Model | `make_question`, `make_validation`, `write_config`, `write_png` |
| `fakes.py` | Double | `FakeClient`, `FakeProposer`, `RecordingJudge`, `RecordingProcessController`, `FakeJobManager` |
| `harness.py` | Controller | `WebHarness`, `ProcessHarness`, `GradingWorkspace`, `make_recognizer` |
| `asserts.py` | View | `assert_all_valid`, `assert_step_statuses`, `assert_contains` |

Web diuji lewat `WebHarness` (FastAPI `TestClient` + config tmp + `FakeJobManager` sinkron); job tidak pernah jalan di thread nyata di pytest.

```text
❌ tests/test_foo.py baru
❌ def test_... level modul
❌ Kasus uji di conftest.py / tests/support/ / live Ollama di pytest
❌ Salin Question(...) / config YAML / MagicMock stage per test
❌ uvicorn / browser sungguhan di pytest
✅ class TestFoo + def test_...(self): di file inventaris
✅ Setup dari tests/support/<lapisan>.py; fake sekali pakai boleh nested
✅ Variasi input → @pytest.mark.parametrize
✅ Hapus method/class = kurangi coverage (tidak ada registry)
```

Domain baru → `class TestNama:` di file terdekat (biasanya `test_suite.py`). Skill: `write-math-grader-tests`.
